{"id":"0e5125be-835a-439c-b9e2-93eb699aa504","object":"chat.completion","created":1795243441,"model":"deepseek-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"SELECT DATE_TRUNC('month', r.requested_at) AS month,\n       ROUND(SUM(r.refund_amount), 2) AS refund_amount\nFROM refunds r\nGROUP BY 1\nORDER BY 1\nLIMIT 100;","reasoning_content":"Simple: monthly refund amount sum from refunds by requested_at month. Use SUM(refund_amount). No extra filters. LIMIT needed? Aggregate with GROUP BY - rule says must LIMIT, single-row no-group aggregate exempt. Grouped aggregate needs LIMIT. Hmm, \"必须LIMIT，单行无GROUP BY的COUNT/SUM/AVG等聚合除外\" - grouped query technically should have LIMIT. But month series... I'll add LIMIT 100.\n\nOrdering time ascending."},"logprobs":null,"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":2665,"completion_tokens":156,"total_tokens":2821,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":2432},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":103},"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":2432,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":233},"system_fingerprint":"bc19ba97cbe016479903222bb1578db6"}